  ('algorithms', 6, 'Check for Valid Anagram?', 'Beginner', '**
Two strings are anagrams if they contain the same characters with the same frequencies. Use a frequency map (or array for 26 lowercase letters) to count and compare.', '**Difficulty**: Beginner

**Strategy**:
**
Two strings are anagrams if they contain the same characters with the same frequencies. Use a frequency map (or array for 26 lowercase letters) to count and compare.

**Code Example**:
```javascript
function isAnagram(s, t) {
  if (s.length !== t.length) return false;
  const map = {};
  for (let char of s) map[char] = (map[char] || 0) + 1;
  for (let char of t) {
    if (!map[char]) return false;
    map[char]--;
  }
  return true;
}
```

