  ('algorithms', 21, 'Valid Parentheses (Stack)?', 'Beginner', '**
Use a Stack. Push opening brackets. When closing bracket appears, check if matches stack top. If stack empty or mismatch, invalid. At end, stack must be empty.', '**Difficulty**: Beginner

**Strategy**:
**
Use a Stack. Push opening brackets. When closing bracket appears, check if matches stack top. If stack empty or mismatch, invalid. At end, stack must be empty.

**Code Example**:
```javascript
function isValid(s) {
  const stack = [];
  const map = { "(": ")", "{": "}", "[": "]" };
  for (let char of s) {
    if (map[char]) stack.push(map[char]);
    else if (stack.pop() !== char) return false;
  }
  return stack.length === 0;
}
```

