  ('algorithms', 29, 'Lowest Common Ancestor of BST?', 'Intermediate', '**
For BST: If both p and q are smaller than root, go left. If both larger, go right. Otherwise, root is the split point (LCA).', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
**
For BST: If both p and q are smaller than root, go left. If both larger, go right. Otherwise, root is the split point (LCA).

**Code Example**:
```javascript
function lowestCommonAncestor(root, p, q) {
  if (p.val < root.val && q.val < root.val)
    return lowestCommonAncestor(root.left, p, q);
  if (p.val > root.val && q.val > root.val)
    return lowestCommonAncestor(root.right, p, q);
  return root;
}
```

