  ('algorithms', 31, 'Find Minimum in Rotated Sorted Array?', 'Intermediate', '**
Binary Search. If `nums[mid] > nums[right]`, min is in right half (`l = mid + 1`). Else, min is at mid or left (`r = mid`).', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
**
Binary Search. If `nums[mid] > nums[right]`, min is in right half (`l = mid + 1`). Else, min is at mid or left (`r = mid`).

**Code Example**:
```javascript
function findMin(nums) {
  let l = 0,
    r = nums.length - 1;
  while (l < r) {
    const mid = Math.floor((l + r) / 2);
    if (nums[mid] > nums[r]) l = mid + 1;
    else r = mid;
  }
  return nums[l];
}
```

