  ('algorithms', 35, 'Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters?', 'Intermediate', '**
Sliding Window with Set/Map. Expand `right` pointer. If char exists in window, contract `left` pointer until unique. Update max length.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
**
Sliding Window with Set/Map. Expand `right` pointer. If char exists in window, contract `left` pointer until unique. Update max length.

**Code Example**:
```javascript
function lengthOfLongestSubstring(s) {
  const set = new Set();
  let l = 0,
    max = 0;
  for (let r = 0; r < s.length; r++) {
    while (set.has(s[r])) set.delete(s[l++]);
    set.add(s[r]);
    max = Math.max(max, set.size);
  }
  return max;
}
```

