  ('angular', 18, 'What is the new Control Flow syntax in Angular 17+ (`@if`, `@for`, `@switch`)?', 'Beginner', 'Replaces `*ngIf`, `*ngFor`, and `*ngSwitch` with native built-in template syntax that compiles to faster JavaScript without importing `CommonModule`.', '**Difficulty**: Beginner

