}

.custom-checkbox input:checked ~ .checkmark::after {
  display: block;
}', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
  ('css', 6, 'How do you implement Dark Mode using CSS Variables?', 'Intermediate', 'CSS custom properties (variables) are the foundation of theming systems in modern web apps. Defining colors in `:root` and overriding them with a data-attribute selector or `prefers-color-scheme` media query creates a clean separation between theme definitions and component styles. The `transition` on background-color provides a polished switch. In real-world apps, pair the data-attribute approach with JavaScript to persist user preference in localStorage.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
CSS custom properties (variables) are the foundation of theming systems in modern web apps. Defining colors in `:root` and overriding them with a data-attribute selector or `prefers-color-scheme` media query creates a clean separation between theme definitions and component styles. The `transition` on background-color provides a polished switch. In real-world apps, pair the data-attribute approach with JavaScript to persist user preference in localStorage.

**Code Example**:
```css
:root {
  --bg-color: white;
  --text-color: black;
}

[data-theme=''dark''] {
  --bg-color: #121212;
  --text-color: #ffffff;
}

body {
  background-color: var(--bg-color);
  color: var(--text-color);
  transition: background-color 0.3s;
}
```

---

<a id="q7"></a>', ':root {
  --bg-color: white;
  --text-color: black;
}

[data-theme=''dark''] {
  --bg-color: #121212;
  --text-color: #ffffff;
}

body {
  background-color: var(--bg-color);
  color: var(--text-color);
  transition: background-color 0.3s;
}', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
  ('css', 7, 'How do you create a responsive aspect ratio box (e.g., 16:9 video embed)?', 'Intermediate', 'Maintaining aspect ratios is essential for responsive video embeds, image placeholders, and card layouts. The modern `aspect-ratio` property is the preferred approach and has broad browser support. The older padding-top hack exploits the fact that vertical padding percentages resolve against the element''s width, not height. In interviews, mention both approaches to show awareness of legacy techniques while favoring the modern solution.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
Maintaining aspect ratios is essential for responsive video embeds, image placeholders, and card layouts. The modern `aspect-ratio` property is the preferred approach and has broad browser support. The older padding-top hack exploits the fact that vertical padding percentages resolve against the element''s width, not height. In interviews, mention both approaches to show awareness of legacy techniques while favoring the modern solution.

**Code Example**:
```css
/* Modern Way */
.video-container {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  background: #000;
}

/* Old "Padding Hack" */
.aspect-ratio-box {
  width: 100%;
  padding-top: 56.25%; /* 9/16 = 0.5625 */
  position: relative;
}

.aspect-ratio-box > iframe {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}
```

---

<a id="q8"></a>', '/* Modern Way */
.video-container {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  background: #000;
}

/* Old "Padding Hack" */
