  ('database', 19, 'How do you perform an Upsert (Insert or Update) in SQL?', 'Beginner', '**
Use `INSERT ... ON CONFLICT` (Postgres) or `INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE` (MySQL) to handle unique constraint violations gracefully.', '**Difficulty**: Beginner

