  ('design-patterns', 4, 'How does the Builder Pattern help in object construction?', 'Intermediate', '**
Separate the construction of a complex object from its representation. It allows you to construct complex objects step-by-step.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
**
Separate the construction of a complex object from its representation. It allows you to construct complex objects step-by-step.

**Code Example**:
```javascript
class CarBuilder {
  constructor() {
    this.car = new Car();
  }
  
  setSeats(seats) {
    this.car.seats = seats;
    return this;
  }
  
  setEngine(engine) {
    this.car.engine = engine;
    return this;
  }
  
  build() {
    return this.car;
  }
}

const car = new CarBuilder().setSeats(4).setEngine(''V8'').build();
```

