  ('design-patterns', 8, 'How does the Facade Pattern simplify complex systems?', 'Beginner', '**
Provide a simplified interface to a library, a framework, or any other complex set of classes. It hides the complexity of the subsystem.', '**Difficulty**: Beginner

**Strategy**:
**
Provide a simplified interface to a library, a framework, or any other complex set of classes. It hides the complexity of the subsystem.

**Code Example**:
```javascript
class ComputerFacade {
  constructor() {
    this.cpu = new CPU();
    this.memory = new Memory();
    this.disk = new HardDrive();
  }
  
  start() {
    this.cpu.freeze();
    this.memory.load(this.bootAddress, this.disk.read(this.bootSector, this.sectorSize));
    this.cpu.jump(this.bootAddress);
    this.cpu.execute();
  }
}
```

---

