  ('design-patterns', 18, 'What is the Memento Pattern used for?', 'Advanced', '**
Capture and externalize an object''s internal state so that the object can be restored to this state later (e.g., undo/redo).', '**Difficulty**: Advanced

**Strategy**:
**
Capture and externalize an object''s internal state so that the object can be restored to this state later (e.g., undo/redo).

**Code Example**:
```javascript
class Memento {
  constructor(state) {
    this.state = state;
  }
  getState() { return this.state; }
}

class Originator {
  save() { return new Memento(this.state); }
  restore(memento) { this.state = memento.getState(); }
}
```

---

