  ('design-patterns', 21, 'How do you implement the Chain of Responsibility Pattern?', 'Advanced', '**
Pass requests along a chain of handlers. Upon receiving a request, each handler decides either to process the request or to pass it to the next handler in the chain.', '**Difficulty**: Advanced

**Strategy**:
**
Pass requests along a chain of handlers. Upon receiving a request, each handler decides either to process the request or to pass it to the next handler in the chain.

**Code Example**:
```javascript
class Handler {
  setNext(handler) {
    this.next = handler;
    return handler;
  }
  
  handle(request) {
    if (this.next) {
      return this.next.handle(request);
    }
    return null;
  }
}
```

---

<a id="q22"></a>', 'class Handler {
