# Download and Merge
git pull origin main', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
  ('git', 7, 'How do you modify the last commit message?', 'Beginner', 'Use `--amend`. This rewrites the last commit ID, so **never** do this if you have already pushed the commit to a shared branch (unless you force push and warn team).', '**Difficulty**: Beginner

**Strategy**:
Use `--amend`. This rewrites the last commit ID, so **never** do this if you have already pushed the commit to a shared branch (unless you force push and warn team).

**Code Example**:
