  ('git', 80, 'Difference between Submodules and Subtrees?', 'Advanced', '**Submodules**: Separate repo links. Complex to manage, requires explicit updates. 
**Subtrees**: Copies source code into your repo. Easier for users of the repo, harder to contribute back.', '**Difficulty**: Advanced

**Strategy**:
**Submodules**: Separate repo links. Complex to manage, requires explicit updates. 
**Subtrees**: Copies source code into your repo. Easier for users of the repo, harder to contribute back.

**Code Example**:
```bash
# Submodule
git submodule add https://github.com/libs/lib.git
# Subtree
git subtree add --prefix=lib https://github.com/libs/lib.git main --squash
```

---

