  ('graphql', 99, 'GraphQL over WebSockets vs HTTP/2 Streams?', 'Advanced', 'Traditionally, Subscriptions used WebSockets for persistent connections. However, HTTP/2 Streams (and Server-Sent Events) are becoming popular as they are easier to manage through firewalls/proxies and don''t require a separate protocol handshake. `@stream` and `@defer` typically use multipart HTTP responses.', '**Difficulty**: Advanced

