  ('react-native', 4, 'What is the difference between FlatList, SectionList, and FlashList (Shopify)?', 'Intermediate', '`FlatList` renders virtualized items by recycling component keys, but unmounts off-screen components causing memory churn. `FlashList` by Shopify truly recycles native UI views without disposing them, achieving 5x faster list scrolling with zero blank cells.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
`FlatList` renders virtualized items by recycling component keys, but unmounts off-screen components causing memory churn. `FlashList` by Shopify truly recycles native UI views without disposing them, achieving 5x faster list scrolling with zero blank cells.

**Code Example**:
```tsx
import { FlashList } from "@shopify/flash-list";

<FlashList
  data={items}
  renderItem={({ item }) => <UserRow user={item} />}
  estimatedItemSize={80}
/>
```

