- Anti-pattern: Memoizing trivial calculations or callbacks passed to plain DOM tags. Memoization incurs memory for dependency arrays and comparison overhead. Use only when passing to `React.memo` components, preserving object references for hook dependencies, or heavy calculations.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
