  ('react', 34, 'How do you implement custom `useInterval` hook?', 'Intermediate', 'Store latest callback in ref to prevent stale closures while keeping interval active.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
Store latest callback in ref to prevent stale closures while keeping interval active.

**Code Example**:
```javascript
export function useInterval(cb, delay) {
  const ref = useRef(cb);
  useEffect(() => { ref.current = cb; }, [cb]);
  useEffect(() => {
    if (delay !== null) {
      const id = setInterval(() => ref.current(), delay);
      return () => clearInterval(id);
    }
  }, [delay]);
}
```

---

