# plus: disable default admin user, remove /debug routes outside staging', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
  ('security', 10, 'How do you manage Vulnerable & Outdated Components (A06)?', 'Intermediate', 'Inventory dependencies (SCA tooling), score with CVSS+exploitability context (EPSS), and remediate via patch SLAs tied to severity. Gate CI on known-vulnerable versions with lockfiles committed, automated update PRs (Renovate/Dependabot), and — for transitive depth — SBOM generation.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
Inventory dependencies (SCA tooling), score with CVSS+exploitability context (EPSS), and remediate via patch SLAs tied to severity. Gate CI on known-vulnerable versions with lockfiles committed, automated update PRs (Renovate/Dependabot), and — for transitive depth — SBOM generation.

**Code Example**:
```yaml
- name: Dependency scan gate
  run: |
    npm ci --ignore-scripts
    npm audit --audit-level=high
    trivy fs --severity HIGH,CRITICAL --exit-code 1 .
```

---

