  ('security', 41, 'How do you prevent username/email enumeration across login, signup, and password reset?', 'Intermediate', 'Enumeration leaks which accounts exist via differential responses, timing, or delivery behavior. Normalize: identical generic messages and timing (constant-work dummy path) for login and reset; on signup, respond neutrally and send "if this account exists" emails; never reveal existence in error codes or reset confirmations.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

