record = aes_gcm_encrypt(dek.Plaintext, row.payload) # fast local crypto
store(record.ciphertext, record.iv, dek.CiphertextBlob)
# rotation: kms.re_encrypt on CiphertextBlobs or new KEK alias — data untouched
```

