  ('security', 96, 'What''s the complete modern security-headers checklist?', 'Intermediate', 'CSP (nonce+strict-dynamic), HSTS (preload), X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, X-Frame-Options/CSP frame-ancestors, Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin, Permissions-Policy (disable unneeded APIs), COOP/CORP/COEP for isolation, and Cache-Control on sensitive responses. Verify with securityheaders.com A+ as a regression gate, not a one-off.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
CSP (nonce+strict-dynamic), HSTS (preload), X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff, X-Frame-Options/CSP frame-ancestors, Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin, Permissions-Policy (disable unneeded APIs), COOP/CORP/COEP for isolation, and Cache-Control on sensitive responses. Verify with securityheaders.com A+ as a regression gate, not a one-off.

**Code Example**:
