  ('sre', 99, 'What is Write-Ahead Logging (WAL) in distributed storage and how does it guarantee durability?', 'Advanced', 'All state changes are appended sequentially to non-volatile disk log before being applied in-memory; allows exact state replay after sudden crash.', '**Difficulty**: Advanced

