<a id="q49"></a>', '<svelte:options immutable={true} />', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
  ('svelte', 49, 'How do you detect if code is running in browser?', 'Beginner', 'Use `browser` from `$app/environment` (SvelteKit) or check `typeof window`.', '**Difficulty**: Beginner

**Strategy**:
Use `browser` from `$app/environment` (SvelteKit) or check `typeof window`.

