<a id="q55"></a>', '<svelte:fragment slot="header">...</svelte:fragment>', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
  ('svelte', 55, 'How do you lazy load a component?', 'Advanced', 'Use dynamic imports in `await` block or SvelteKit''s features.', '**Difficulty**: Advanced

