  ('system-design', 115, 'What is Database Replication?', 'Intermediate', '**
Master-Slave (Write to Master, Read from Slaves) vs Master-Master. Async vs Sync replication. Improves read throughput and availability.', '**Difficulty**: Intermediate

**Strategy**:
**
Master-Slave (Write to Master, Read from Slaves) vs Master-Master. Async vs Sync replication. Improves read throughput and availability.

**Code Example**:
