  ('tailwind-bootstrap', 5, 'How does Bootstrap 5 Grid System compare to modern CSS Grid and Flexbox in Tailwind?', 'Beginner', 'Bootstrap 5 uses a 12-column flexbox grid (`.container`, `.row`, `.col-md-6`) utilizing negative margins and padding gutters. Tailwind supports both flexbox grids and modern native 2D CSS Grid (`grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6`), enabling complex grid templates and subgrid layouts directly in markup.', '**Difficulty**: Beginner

